name: sim.getJointPosition
description: Retrieves the linear/angular position of a joint. This function cannot be used with spherical joints (use sim.getObjectChildPose instead)
luaSynopsis: float position = sim.getJointPosition(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float position = sim.getJointPosition(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the joint
outputs:
1. position: linear/angular position of the joint
